# Trusted release signing keys, one base64 Ed25519 public key per line.
# Blank lines and lines starting with # are ignored. This file is embedded in the binary.
#
# While this file contains no key, builds of this repository do NOT verify release signatures
# and in-app updates rely on the SHA256SUMS checksum only. Once a key is listed here, every
# update must carry a SHA256SUMS.sig that verifies against one of the listed keys.
#
# The maintainer generates a key pair with `counterweight release-keygen`, adds the public line
# here and stores the private key as a secret. See docs/operations.md, "Release signatures".
